#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:2
msgid "Layouts"
msgstr "Layouts"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:4
msgid ""
"Layouts are attached to Instance Types. A Layout can only be attached to "
"a single Instance Type and a single Technology. An Instance Type can have"
" one or many Layouts attached to it, allowing for a single Instance Type "
"to work with any Technology type. Node Types are added to Layouts. A "
"Layout can have one or many node types attached to it. Node types can be "
"shared across Layouts of matching Technology types."
msgstr ""
"Layouts are attached to Tipos de instancia. A Layout can only be attached"
" to a single Tipo de instancia and a single Technology. An Tipo de "
"instancia can have one or many Layouts attached to it, allowing for a "
"single Tipo de instancia to work with any Technology type. Tipos de nodo "
"are added to Layouts. A Layout can have one or many node types attached "
"to it. Node types puede ser shared across Layouts of matching Technology "
"types."

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:6
msgid "Important"
msgstr "Importante"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:6
msgid ""
"Once an Instance Type is defined on a Layout and saved, the Instance Type"
" setting and Technology selections on the Layout cannot be changed."
msgstr ""
"Once an Tipo de instancia is defined on a Layout and saved, the Tipo de "
"instancia setting and Technology selections on the Layout no puede ser "
"changed."

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:9
msgid "Layout List View"
msgstr "Layout List View"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:11
msgid ""
"The default page for Layouts is the Layout list view. Select :guilabel:`+"
" ADD` to create a new Layout. Layouts can also be created from an "
"Instance Type detail page."
msgstr ""
"El/La predeterminado/predeterminada page para Layouts es el/la Layout "
"list view. Select :guilabel:`+ ADD` a create un/una nuevo/nueva Layout. "
"Layouts puede/n también be creado/creada desde un/una Tipo de instancia "
"detail page."

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:13
msgid "The following fields are displayed for each Layout:"
msgstr "El/La following fields son displayed para cada Layout:"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:15
msgid ""
"**INSTANCE TYPE:** Select the Instance Type to associate with the Layout."
" This attribute is automatically set and not shown when creating the "
"Layout from an Instance Type detail page"
msgstr ""
"**INSTANCE TYPE:** Select el/la Tipo de instancia a associate con el/la "
"Layout. Este/Esta attribute es automatically establecido/establecida y "
"ningún shown cuando creating el/la Layout desde un/una Tipo de instancia "
"detail page"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:16
msgid "**NAME:** Links to the Layout detail page"
msgstr "**NAME:** Links to the Layout detail page"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:17
msgid "**VERSION**"
msgstr "**VERSION**"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:18
msgid ""
"**DISPLAY ORDER:** Determines the Layout display order in the "
"provisioning wizard when adding an Instance of the associated Instance "
"Type"
msgstr ""
"**DISPLAY ORDER:** Determines el/la Layout display order en el/la "
"provisioning wizard cuando adding un/una Instancia de el/la "
"asociado/asociada Tipo de instancia"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:19
msgid "**DESCRIPTION**"
msgstr "**DESCRIPTION**"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:21
#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:29
#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:49
#, fuzzy
msgid "Note"
