#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:21
msgid ""
"The order of Layouts given when an Instance Type is being provisioned is "
"in high-to-low order of the Layout Display Order property. Bear in mind "
"this is reversed from how Service Plans are ordered, which is in low-to-"
"high order based on the Display Order value."
msgstr ""
"El/La order de Layouts given cuando un/una Tipo de instancia es being "
"provisioned es en high-to-low order de el/la Layout Display Order "
"property. Bear en mind este/esta es reversed desde how Service Plans son "
"ordered, el/la cual es en low-to-high order based en el/la Display Order "
"value."

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:23
msgid "The Actions menu in each row reveals the following options:"
msgstr "El/La Actions menu en cada row reveals el/la following options:"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Permissions:** Scope the Layout to Group(s) to narrow the list of "
"available groups for a chosen Instance Type at provision time"
msgstr ""
"**Permissions:** Scope el/la Layout a Grupo(s) a narrow el/la list de "
"disponible groups para un/una chosen Tipo de instancia en provision time"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:26
msgid "**Edit:** Edit the Layout"
msgstr "**Edit:** Edit the Layout"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:27
msgid "**Delete:** Delete the Layout"
msgstr "**Delete:** Delete the Layout"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:29
msgid "A Layout that is in use cannot be deleted."
msgstr "A Layout that is in use no puede ser deleted."

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:31
msgid "Available Filters:"
msgstr "Available Filters:"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:33
msgid "**Technology:** Display Layouts by selected Cloud technology"
msgstr "**Technology:** Display Layouts by selected Nube technology"

#: ../../library/blueprints/layouts.rst:34
msgid "**Instance Type:** Display Layouts by the associated Instance Type"
